# unit_records_02: unit tests (call) from the start of a Novice race for
# the course screens' records pages and their menus (02:EDD2-F926) and the
# records' sprite helpers (02:FBAA-FF6C), which plays reach only by jumps
# or not at all: each menu with no press, each pad press it tests and the
# countdown still running, each cursor place; the pages with and without
# the second-choice flag; the digit, letter and piece helpers on a spread
# of values.
